‪You might want to whiten your teeth.

479
00:21:05,430 --> 00:21:07,766
‪You look really nice in every way.

480
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:10,519
‪But there's just one thing

481
00:21:11,311 --> 00:21:12,312
‪you could improve.

482
00:21:12,396 --> 00:21:14,231
‪I think whitening your teeth would help.

483
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:17,109
‪I think whitening your teeth would help.

484
00:21:19,319 --> 00:21:20,195
‪You're right.

485
00:21:22,155 --> 00:21:25,367
‪You know, most people
‪wouldn't say things like this.

486
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:27,953
‪I was just thinking

487
00:21:28,036 --> 00:21:29,162
‪that if you whiten your teeth,

488
00:21:29,246 --> 00:21:30,455
‪-you'll become a goddess.
‪-Enough.

489
00:21:30,539 --> 00:21:32,541
‪-Okay, that's enough.
‪-I'm sorry.

490
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:37,296
‪I'm just kidding. But seriously,
‪I think you're a really good person.

491
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:39,840
‪-You laugh at my jokes, and I like that.
‪-Really?

492
00:21:41,425 --> 00:21:44,845
‪I think it's an honor
‪to talk to you like this.

493
00:21:46,013 --> 00:21:47,764
‪The honor is mine.

494
00:21:50,309 --> 00:21:52,561
‪I enjoyed our blind date,

495
00:21:52,644 --> 00:21:54,271
‪but I have to go home now.

496
00:21:56,940 --> 00:21:58,066
‪Can you…

497
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:00,527
‪Can you stay a bit longer?

498
00:22:00,610 --> 00:22:02,404
‪He said, "Stay a bit longer."

499
00:22:03,947 --> 00:22:04,948
‪I'll see you next time.

500
00:22:06,825 --> 00:22:08,910
‪Will there be a next time?

501
00:22:08,994 --> 00:22:10,454
‪-A next time?
‪-Yes.

502
00:22:10,537 --> 00:22:11,455
‪Well…

503
00:22:14,875 --> 00:22:16,793
‪"Will there be a next time?"

504
00:22:16,877 --> 00:22:19,796
‪I want you to yell
‪in the crew's direction,

505
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:22,257
‪"Send in the next woman!"

506
00:22:23,884 --> 00:22:26,428
‪-I'll see you next time.
‪-Next, please!

507
00:22:27,054 --> 00:22:28,388
‪There's no one after me!

508
00:22:28,472 --> 00:22:31,141
‪-Yeo-myung isn't here. It's just me!
‪-Yeo-myung…

509
00:22:31,767 --> 00:22:34,311
‪I'm serious. I'm the last one!

510
00:22:35,228 --> 00:22:36,480
‪Goodbye. See you next time.

511
00:22:36,563 --> 00:22:37,647
‪Take care.

512
00:22:50,118 --> 00:22:50,994
<i>‪I didn't want it to end.</i>

513
00:22:51,495 --> 00:22:54,539
‪My heart fluttered the most
‪when she first walked in.

514
00:22:54,623 --> 00:22:59,169
<i>‪I really thought she was a celebrity</i>
<i>‪right up until she came in.</i>

515
00:22:59,252 --> 00:23:00,337
‪-Oh, hello.
‪-Hello.

516
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:02,714
<i>‪I thought it was insane.</i>

517
00:23:04,091 --> 00:23:05,884
‪He seems very soft and gentle.

518
00:23:05,967 --> 00:23:07,761
‪I think he's very soft

519
00:23:07,844 --> 00:23:09,554
‪and innocent.

520
00:23:10,555 --> 00:23:12,057
‪The blind date wasn't successful,

521
00:23:12,140 --> 00:23:14,226
‪but I wasn't offended or anything.

522
00:23:15,227 --> 00:23:18,563
‪He's someone who struggles
‪to lead a conversation,

523
00:23:18,647 --> 00:23:20,857
<i>‪so I think he managed to talk</i>
<i>‪as much as he did</i>

524
00:23:20,941 --> 00:23:23,568
<i>‪because it was an avatar blind date.</i>

525
00:23:23,652 --> 00:23:28,406
<i>‪I think he was able to</i>
<i>‪carry on a conversation with me,</i>

526
00:23:28,490 --> 00:23:30,450
<i>‪thanks to it being an avatar blind date.</i>

527
00:23:46,383 --> 00:23:48,385
‪Subtitle translation by:
‪Jenny Kim
